#. Tag: refpurpose
#: man-kappfinder.1.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "An app to add installed applications to the &kde; menu."
msgstr ""
"En Programm, mit dat sik installeert Programmen na't &kde;-Menü tofögen laat"

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#: man-kappfinder.1.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kappfinder</command> <group><option>--dir</option> <replaceable> "
"directory</replaceable></group> <group><option>KDE Generic Options</option></"
"group> <group><option>Qt Generic Options</option></group>"
msgstr ""
"<command>kappfinder</command> <group><option>--dir</option> <replaceable> "
"Orner</replaceable></group> <group><option>KDE-Optschonen</option></group> "
"<group><option>Qt-Optschonen</option></group>"

#. Tag: title
#: man-kappfinder.1.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beschrieven"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kappfinder.1.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The KDE application findern (&kappfinder;) looks for legacy and third party "
"applications that are installed on your system and adds them to the KDE menu "
"system."
msgstr ""
"De KDE-Programmsöker &kappfinder; kiekt na oolt un Drüttpartei-Programmen, "
"de op Dien Reekner installeert sünd, un föögt se dat KDE-Menüsysteem to."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kappfinder.1.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Optschonen"

#. Tag: term
#: man-kappfinder.1.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>--dir</option> <replaceable>directory</replaceable>"
msgstr "<option>--dir</option> <replaceable>Orner</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kappfinder.1.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install <filename>.desktop</filename> files into directory "
"<replaceable>directory</replaceable>"
msgstr ""
"<filename>.desktop</filename>-Dateien binnen den Orner <replaceable>Orner</"
"replaceable> installeren"

#. Tag: title
#: man-kappfinder.1.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid "See Also"
msgstr "Kiek ok bi"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kappfinder.1.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"More detailed user documentation is available from <ulink url=\"help:/"
"kappfinder\">help:/kappfinder</ulink> (either enter this <acronym>URL</"
"acronym> into &konqueror;, or run <userinput><command>khelpcenter</command> "
"<parameter>help:/kappfinder</parameter></userinput>)."
msgstr ""
"En Brukerdokmentatschoon mit mehr Enkelheiten is över <ulink url=\"help:/"
"kappfinder\">help:/kappfinder</ulink> verföögbor (giff disse <acronym>URL</"
"acronym> bi &konqueror; in, oder för <userinput><command>khelpcenter</"
"command> <parameter>help:/kappfinder</parameter></userinput> ut)."

